TITLE Albite kinetics with H2S gas
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    Fe(2) 0.004
    Fe(3) 0.004
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m 1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected2.out
    -reset false
    -step true
    -ionic_strength true
END
